          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) If n is odd, then 3n + 4 is odd then some expressions of odd parity would be— 5n + 2, 9n + 4 etc. Some expressions of even parity — 2n + 4, 4n + 6 etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.15,
            0.901,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) If n is even, then 3n + 4 is even then all expression will be even parity — (5n – 2), n + 4 etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.212,
            0.782,
            0.253
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Are there expressions using which we can list all odd numbers? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 2n-1 is the expression that can list all odd numbers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.268,
            0.901,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What would be the nth term for multiples of 2? Or, what is the nth even number?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.311,
            0.198,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 2n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.34,
            0.738,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
